Protected behind its own exclusive entrance, the Bvlgari Villa is an extraordinary 1,300-square-metre villa clad in stone that is truly one of a kind. The centerpiece of this two-storey jewel atop the cliff is a 20-metre heated swimming pool, which reaches toward the sapphire Indian Ocean and cascades into a second lower pool. Amid the verdant gardens and large lawn are intimate thatched-roof pavilions for outdoor living and relaxation as well plush sun beds and a meditation pergola framed by an extensive terrace.

 

The feeling of total privacy continues inside the grand residence, the first floor of which offers guests a handsome living room accented by Balinese artwork as well as a separate elegant dining room, a bar and a kitchen. The dedicated spa room allows guests the option to experience wellness treatments in the comfort of their own villa, while there is also a cinema room for movie nights. Upstairs, two extensive suites capture the privileged ocean vista. In addition to Bvlgari’s divine beds, each has its own sitting area, terrace, large walk-in closet and extravagant bathroom, including a soaking tub.

